  "name": "PERSONA-01: Identity versus Procedure in Evidence-Grounded Research Assistance",
  "alternateName": "SILENCE PERSONA-01",
  "description": "Proposed pre-registration (not yet registered): 2x2 factorial protocol (expert identity x verification procedure) testing whether an AI expert persona improves evidence-grounded decisions beyond an identical explicit procedure. Main contrast D-C. Method only; task sets and answer keys are private.",
